<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 600px; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td style="font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #1f4fd8; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">Hourmere</p>
<p>如需登录 Hourmere，请点击下方按钮，然后在打开的页面上点击<span class="cjk-quote" style="font-variant-east-asian: full-width; font-feature-settings: 'fwid';">“</span>登录 Hourmere<span class="cjk-quote" style="font-variant-east-asian: full-width; font-feature-settings: 'fwid';">”</span>。</p>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td style="padding: 16px 0; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td bgcolor="#1f4fd8" style="padding: 0; mso-padding-alt: 12px 18px; background-color: #1f4fd8; border: 1px solid #1f4fd8; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="https://cal.example.com/sign-in/confirm#token=abc&amp;callbackURL=%2F" style="display: block; padding: 12px 18px; line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">登录</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p style="color: #555;">此链接将在 5 分钟后过期，且仅能使用一次。如果你没有申请登录，可以忽略此邮件。</p>
<p style="color: #555; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">如果按钮无法使用，请将此链接复制到浏览器中：<br><a href="https://cal.example.com/sign-in/confirm#token=abc&amp;callbackURL=%2F" style="color: #1f4fd8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">https://cal.example.com/sign-in/confirm#token=abc&amp;callbackURL=%2F</a></p>
<p style="margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 16px; color: #555; font-size: 13px;">你收到此邮件是因为有人为你的 Hourmere 账号申请了登录链接。</p>
